================================================================
149. TEST SUITE EXPANSION
================================================================

Upgrade-17 added only 3 tests.

Upgrade-18 requires substantially broader coverage.

Add tests for:

quality result scoring
fixture versioning
validator authority
test deletion defense
security hard gate
tool reliability
prompt profile versioning
context strategy
quality floor
promotion
quarantine
rollback
evidence invalidation
canary
A/B assignment
routing confidence
failure attribution
tenant scope
offline execution
zero-paid policy

================================================================
150. PROPERTY TESTS
================================================================

Where useful, test invariants:

security failure can never become preferred
paid provider can never enter zero-cost candidate set
quarantined profile cannot route
stale evidence cannot produce HIGH confidence

================================================================
151. CONCURRENCY TESTS
================================================================

Two benchmark workers must not promote conflicting baselines
simultaneously.

Use transactional/version semantics.

================================================================
152. PROMOTION CAS
================================================================

Promotion should use expected baseline/version.

Prevent stale benchmark from overwriting newer preference.

================================================================
153. AUDIT
================================================================

Audit:

quality profile change
benchmark
promotion
quarantine
rollback
manual override

================================================================
154. OBSERVABILITY
================================================================

Metrics:

quality_runs_total
quality_pass_total
quality_regressions_total
model_promotions_total
model_quarantines_total

Avoid model/project high-cardinality labels in Prometheus.

================================================================
155. RETENTION
================================================================

Keep detailed quality evidence according to project/tenant retention.

Aggregates may have different retention.

