================================================================
157. VERSION DECISION
================================================================

Inspect actual release history.

Do not mechanically keep 1.40.0.

Quality Engineering adds a significant new subsystem but may remain a
minor release if backward-compatible.

Explain actual SemVer decision.

================================================================
158. REQUIRED COMMANDS
================================================================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python -m build
git diff --check
git status --short

clean wheel install
zcoder --version

Run separately:

quality unit suite
quality fixture suite
promotion/quarantine suite
prompt-profile suite
adaptive-routing suite
security-quality suite
offline quality E2E
zero-paid quality E2E
self-hosted Web profile

If actual local model exists:

run real local quality benchmarks separately.

Never fabricate them.

================================================================
159. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-18 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-17 evidence tiers are revalidated
[ ] quality is distinct from performance
[ ] quality fixtures are deterministic/versioned
[ ] objective validators drive correctness
[ ] model cannot pass by deleting tests
[ ] security failures hard-fail quality
[ ] tool reliability is measured
[ ] prompt profiles are versioned
[ ] prompt optimization cannot modify immutable security layer
[ ] context/RAG strategies can be evaluated
[ ] project-specific quality baselines exist
[ ] model quality lifecycle exists
[ ] promotion requires evidence
[ ] quarantine works
[ ] last-known-good rollback works
[ ] stale evidence is invalidated
[ ] quality regression detection works
[ ] adaptive routing uses quality floor
[ ] fast-but-wrong model loses to slower-correct model
[ ] A/B/canary cannot double-mutate repositories
[ ] zero-paid policy remains central
[ ] offline quality lab works
[ ] no customer code is uploaded
[ ] no chain-of-thought is stored
[ ] tenant isolation remains intact
[ ] inherited production-runtime gates remain green

